{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o061a","title":"韩暨去世","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o061a-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"韩暨去世","evidence":["mingdi-e-o061a-q"]},{"id":"hancui-a-cf5a0c50cef02063db23","label":"正文","text":"景初二年夏四月韩暨卒遗俭葬谥恭侯","evidence":["hancui-q-2b08e060b00e2219b1e9"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mingdi-p0021","role":"卒","evidence":["mingdi-e-o061a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":238,"label":"夏四月庚子","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y238","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o059","basis":"夏四月庚子"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o061a-q","mingdi-q-o059","mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o061a-q","source_order":[3,437,"O061a"],"order":942}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0021","name":"韩暨","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hancui-q-2b08e060b00e2219b1e9","section":"chapter-024","block":"b-eead853d8d29889bbf8b","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，薨；遗令敛以时服，葬为土藏〖7〗。谥曰恭侯。","section_title":"韩崔高孙王传第二十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0054.xhtml","index":28,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":60,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-e-o061a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-f165ec46b1fa65c10705","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月，庚子〖5〗，司徒韩暨薨。壬寅〖6〗，分沛国萧、相、竹邑、符离、蕲、铚、龙亢、山桑、洨、虹﹝二﹞十县〖7〗，为汝阴郡；宋县、陈郡苦县皆属谯郡〖8〗。以沛、杼秋、公丘、彭城丰国、广戚并五县〖9〗，为沛王国。庚戌〖10〗，大赦。五月，乙亥〖11〗，月犯心距星，又犯中央大星。﹝三﹞六月，省渔阳郡之狐奴县〖12〗，复置安乐县〖13〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":436,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":167,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-78ee587f18f11aa30bd9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：景初二年（公元 238 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":438,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-917b5dc4aecce5a0dcf4","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o059","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5790b2efe14805978c50","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，诏太尉司马宣王。率众讨辽东。﹝一﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":434,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
